  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - GRANT\r\nReason:\r\nThe London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 30/10/2025, the use of a room with \"20 Marlborough Road, Feltham, TW13 5HL\" as an office for a chauffer booking service would not result in a change of use of part of/ or the whole dwellinghouse and is therefore lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\nThe use of the room within the existing dwellinghouse to operate as an office for a chauffer booking service, with no external alterations; no picking up or dropping off of customers at the site or comings and goings of drivers to the premises does not represent a change of use of part or whole of the property and therefore permission is not required.\r\n"
  ],
